Package: linus-session
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: linus project <linus@example.com>
Depends: sway, mantle, dbus-user-session, pipewire, wireplumber, network-manager, upower, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Recommends: swaynag, foot, hyprland, xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Description: linus session and compositor configuration layer
 Provides the Wayland session entries, sway/Hyprland compositor drop-in
 configs that autostart the mantle shell, session environment setup,
 default mantle config and theme skeleton, and XDG portal configuration.
 .
 On failure, keeps the compositor alive with a visible recovery notice so
 users are never left with a blank screen.
